## Coordinator Integration

Integrate T1 and T2 in the approved order. Resolve conflicts without contract
drift, rerun `{{EXACT_PROJECT_OR_PROFILE_GATE_COMMAND}}`, and record the result.

`task-plan.json` is the machine-readable, approval-bound DAG. Keep these
checkbox ids and their order identical to that file. At Design all boxes must be
unchecked. After each successful task, Harness must call
`record_task_completion.py complete`; it records execution evidence and changes
only that task to `- [x]`. Never edit a checkbox manually.

If Apply is interrupted, keep the change in `IMPLEMENTING` and run
`record_task_completion.py resume <change-dir> --actor <agent> --json`. It
repairs this projection from validated execution evidence and reports the next
ready DAG wave. Existing source changes without a validated task run remain
pending.
